          alt: "First aid for severe bleeding, burns, snakebite, epistaxis, seizures and fractures, emphasising the actions that must not be taken in each: no tourniquet on a snakebite, no removing a soaked dressing, nothing in the mouth of a fitting patient, no straightening a fracture.",
          caption: "Severe bleeding: press hard, keep pressing, add layers, elevate, dress, splint, tourniquet only for a limb bleed that pressure cannot control — and never for a snakebite. Most of first aid is doing the simple thing continuously and not doing the harmful thing at all.",
